message: "If you use MetaWorks 2.0 in your research, please cite the MetaWorks paper and the archived software release."
title: "MetaWorks 2.0"
version: "2.0.0"
date-released: "2026-08-31"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22210764
type: software
license: GPL-3.0-only
repository-code: "https://github.com/Hajibabaei-Lab/MetaWorks-2.0"
url: "https://github.com/Hajibabaei-Lab/MetaWorks-2.0"
abstract: "MetaWorks 2.0 is a modular, API-backed, web-operable metabarcoding platform for ESV and OTU workflows. It migrates the v1 Snakemake pipeline to a rule-module architecture, adds validated configuration management, replaces Perl helper scripts with Python, introduces FastAPI and Vue interfaces, and adds Docker Compose deployment."
